ed drow begin an uprising led by a brave priestess.","16 | Several elife elf warriors need an escort into the Underworld. They are planning to assassinate a drow leader.","17 | The party is sent on a quest to retrieve a large amount of a rare metal for a wealthy king.","18 | A group of heroes finds a treasure map that leads to an abandoned underground city.","19 | Miners unearth a dangerous monster or powerful magical force.","20 | A half-orc spy helps the party enter the orc caverns on a mission to eliminate the evil humanoids from the Underworld.","21 | A party of adventurers must attempt to escape from the Underworld after being taken prisoner.","22 | Magical mushrooms send the heroes on a wild trip below the surface world.","23 | On a voyage through the Underworld, the heroes find a hidden city under a subterranean lake.","24 | A powerful noble has hired the adventuring party to eliminate a drow assassin who lives in the dark elf capital.","25 | Giants from the surface world enlist the help of mercenaries to eliminate the unpredictable Giant Queen."],"tx":"underworld adventure hooks table monsters of the underworld"},{"n":"Underworld Encounters Table [Under]","s":"underworld-26b4","sub":"Table • Under","tl":[["Columns","d100 | Encounter"]],"p":["01 | lava dragon","02 | spider golem","03 | hag queen","04 | thunder giant","05 | giant roper","06 | fungi worm","07 | lava giant","08 | drow assassin","09 | dark maiden","10 | giant zombie","11 | illuminai","12 | grim druid","13 | toadstool fool","14 | duergar stone knight","15 | monster hunter","16 | dwarf crasher","17 | demon frog","18 | drow sage","19 | deep guide","20 | 1d4 dwarf bear rider","21 | cave troll","22 | boomslang","23 | 1d4 drow rebel","24 | 1d4 diamond dog","25 | 1d6 germ worm","26 | 1d4 deep gnome ranger","27 | 1d4 drow spider rider","28 | 1d4 dwarf miner","29 | 1d6 orc bat rider","30 | 1d4 spore farmer","31 | careless whisper","32 | echo gecko","33 | orc shaman","34 | chasm fiend","35 | monstrous spid